FLOOR 6 of 9 - THE SHULKER BOXES

You found a shulker box. It has no label and no file extension,
and inside it there is another box, and inside that one another.
Each box was packed with a different tool, so find out what kind of
file you are holding before you try to open it.

The last thing you unpack is not text. It is raw loot, but a readable
sentence is buried inside it: the password for locstd06.

Your home folder is read-only, so do the unpacking in a folder under /tmp.
